      "message": "Hi Kelly, thanks for the great review! You are right that this early log is critical for analyzing resume crashes before PM_POST_SUSPEND is reached.\nI am preparing Patchset 2, where we will safely buffer the IRQ number and name inside the IRQ handler, and defer calling pr_warn() (preserving the exact same log format) until right after IRQs are re-enabled in suspend_enter(). This keeps the timing practically identical for crash analysis while completely breaking the lock inversion",
